WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.860
Hi, I'm Mysbah, a UGC creator
and a [unclear] based in Pakistan.

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:07.140
But honestly, I work with brands
all over the world.

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:10.900
I have spent the last two years
creating content across beauty,

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:14.020
tech, lifestyle, travel,
and testimonials.

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:16.980
If there is one thing I believe,
it's that:

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.940
people don't trust ads;
they trust recommendations.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:22.380
And that's what I exactly create:

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:24.680
content that feels like a friend

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:27.060
telling you about a product
they actually love.

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.480
I am big on storytelling.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:31.780
I don't just show a product;
I show why it matters.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.420
I'm passionate, I'm fun, I'm creative,

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:36.860
and I genuinely care about
building connections

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:38.780
between brands and their audience.

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:41.940
So, if that sounds like
what you are looking for,

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:43.400
let's collaborate!
